      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "How was the sales/quoting process?:Joel from HV Solar made the whole process easy and straight forward. After we contacted their team, he organised a site visit within a few days and provided four separate honest quotes that came in lower than every other one we received. Most importantly, he didn't try to upsell us with an oversized system we didn't need, like a few others tried to do.How did the installation go?:After excepting our preferred system, he booked us in for our install within the week.And because you know, its 2020, there was an issue with receiving some of our Solaredge components from Melbourne. But Joel was honest, kept us up to date and sent his team over to install all the racking and wiring until the rest of the components arrived. But 2020 wasn't finished and the rain set in. Again we were kept in the loop and the team was sent over as soon as there was a break in the weather to complete the install.The boys that did the install were punctual, polite and took all their rubbish with them.All the paper work for grid connection was submitted on the day of install and Energy Australia contacted us the next day for meter recalibration and plan selection. They actually mentioned that all the paperwork had been submitted rather quickly from their experience.All in all we're more than happy with how Joel and the team handled the whole process from start to finish and would without doubt recommend the HV Solar Team.And most importantly our system looks awesome and is already generating more than quoted, even on these cloudy days!",
